@startuml activity-book-tutoring
title Activity diagram: booking a tutoring session

|Student|
start
:Search offers by skill and date range;
|Ayni|
:Read matching projection\n(all enabled tutors free at each hour);
|Student|
:Choose tutor and one or more consecutive hours;
|Ayni|
if (Hours contiguous and AVAILABLE?) then (no)
  :Show that the hour is no longer available;
  |Student|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Ayni|
:Hold the hours for 5 minutes;
|Student|
:Describe the need (required);
:Confirm booking;
|Ayni|
if (Hold still valid?) then (no)
  :Release hours and notify the student;
  |Student|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Ayni|
partition "One transaction" {
  if (Tutor enabled for the skill?) then (no)
    :Roll back, release hours;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Charge credits, closest to expiring first;
  if (Enough credits?) then (no)
    :Roll back, show missing credits\nand how to get them;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Mark hours BOOKED (version check);
  if (Hour taken concurrently?) then (yes)
    :Roll back charge and booking;
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
  :Save booking CONFIRMED;
}
:Publish BookingConfirmed;
fork
  :sessions creates the session\nand its private room;
fork again
  :matching removes the hours from search;
fork again
  :notifications tells student and tutor;
end fork
|Student|
:See the confirmed booking;
stop
@enduml
